  (text "Section 7 of the circuit notes, as traced [2]: R11/R12 divider, Sallen-Key low-pass IC2_A with the R14 + C10 shelf leg,\nSallen-Key low-pass IC2_B, and the R18/C14/C15/R19 bridged-T notch into the buffer IC1_A. All values reported;\ntheir role as a speaker simulation is inferred. Poles, zeros and the notch come from tools/basspreamp-networks.py,\nwhich also writes the DSP's coefficients, with ideal op-amps." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d1444aeb-8e98-58cf-a566-2e9fcf25a42c"))
